{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">春节假期，还有无数的快递员早晚奔波，服务着万千家庭。<span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong>快递小哥艾延腾今年已是连续第八年春节值守，这几天，他和同事们每天工作至少12个小时</strong></span>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/64448/6/21126/81602/63d12e23F65c49722/4983b2bb501aee65.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;虽然春节假期不能一直陪着家人，但是我们送的这些货都是大家比较期盼的年货，还有生活必需品。&rdquo;艾延腾在接受《新闻联播》采访时说，<span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong>&ldquo;兔年到了，我们小哥信心十足，加油干，多送货！我们也要当新时代的追梦人，为服务百姓，为自己的梦想而努力。&rdquo;</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">艾延腾是京东快递北京房山旭辉营业部负责人，入职京东物流八年多，他凭借出色的业务能力，从一线快递员成长为站长，今年也是他在站点值守的第八个春节了。<span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong>&ldquo;站点和我一样连续几年没回家过年的兄弟还有六七个，年三十忙完工作我们还一起在站点贴了春联、吃了年夜饭，公司给的福利好，所以值守的兄弟们都很有干劲。&rdquo;</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">今年春节，像艾延腾一样值守的京东快递小哥还有数十万，他们都希望自己的坚守能保障消费者的正常寄递需求，让大家过个好年。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&mdash;&mdash;<img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/193658/8/32366/855/63d12e4fFa77f23b1/512cc778c2633c26.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" /> 初四&middot;迎灶神&middot;享美食 <img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/193658/8/32366/855/63d12e4fFa77f23b1/512cc778c2633c26.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" />&mdash;&mdash;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">新年享好物，产地送新鲜</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/101544/34/36777/218037/63d12e60F1097ea5a/240d43d85bf44080.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/131891/40/29596/43354/63d12e74F94c6f1c8/d7d8d07e0bc0f5e4.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "“兔年到了，我们小哥信心十足！”", "contentCode": "content01038", "contentTitle": "《新闻联播》点赞春节值守京东快递小哥！", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1674652933000, "id": 2831, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/216669/20/24361/81602/63d12e82Faa5dbe8e/4a023c4cccd4af3b.jpg", "updateTime": 1674653324000}}